-- Surveyed cemetery lots, extracted from the traced plan in
-- public/traces/survey-lines.png by tracing each plot rectangle in the grid.
-- Coordinates are the plan's own pixels on its 4096x3072 canvas.
--
-- Lot codes are S<plan section number>-<position in that section>, numbered
-- top-to-bottom then left-to-right. Price is the study's stated single-plot
-- value, carried here so a reservation's total is not zero.
--
-- Run after the schema is loaded: `make map-data`.

